GW2 Rotation Coach is distributed as a community addon for Guild Wars 2.
This repository publishes the addon binary distributions, benchmark profiles,
and documentation.


Permitted Use
-------------
You may download and use the GW2 Rotation Coach addon free of charge, including
while playing, streaming, recording, or creating content (such as guides and videos)
on monetized and personal channels. Streamers and content creators are welcome to
feature and showcase GW2 Rotation Coach. You may also quote or reuse this repository's
documentation and screenshots when describing, reviewing, or showcasing the addon,
with attribution.


Distribution via Raidcore / Nexus
---------------------------------
The author grants Raidcore and the Nexus addon library (raidcore.gg) permission
to list, host, and distribute the GW2 Rotation Coach addon, unmodified and free
of charge, to end users through their platform. This permission is limited to
distribution of the addon as released by the author; it conveys no right to sell
or commercially bundle the addon.


Restrictions
------------
Except as expressly permitted above, you may not copy, modify, redistribute,
sell, decompile, disassemble, or reverse engineer the GW2 Rotation Coach software,
nor bundle it into paid commercial software or services without prior written
permission from the author.


ArenaNet Developer Access
-------------------------
The author welcomes review by ArenaNet staff. Verified ArenaNet employees may
request access to source code and implementation details in order to inspect
